{"id":"aottraitor","lines":[{"t":0,"end":5.89,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Who cares, it is what it is, no choice but to face what i have done.","de":"Wen interessiert's — es ist, wie es ist. Bleibt nur, sich dem zu stellen, was ich getan habe.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":7.795,"end":13.547,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"As a warrior, no road left but the one that leads to the end!","de":"Als Krieger bleibt nur der Weg, der zum Ende führt!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":13.82,"end":18.528,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"*Shocked*","de":"*Schock*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":18.57,"end":22.817,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertolt","text":"Reiner, right now, here, were doing this?","de":"Reiner… genau jetzt, genau hier — machen wir das?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":22.892,"end":27.643,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Yes, right here right now, we're settling this once and for all","de":"Ja. Genau hier, genau jetzt. Wir machen das ein für alle Mal klar.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":27.676,"end":28.205,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"*Gasp*","de":"*Keucht*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":28.72,"end":29.149,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Huh","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":29.417,"end":30.836,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"*Grunts* HAAH","de":"*Grunz* HAAH!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":30.847,"end":31.635,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"*Pain*","de":"*Schmerz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":31.802,"end":32.347,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"*Grunts*","de":"*Grunz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":31.802,"end":32.341,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"*Grunts*","de":"*Grunz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":32.675,"end":35.069,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertolt","text":"*Pain*","de":"*Schmerz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":38.15,"end":38.846,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertolt","text":"*Pain*","de":"*Schmerz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":40.14,"end":42.368,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"Eren! Get out of here!","de":"Eren! Verschwind hier!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":42.9,"end":44.586,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"*Pain*","de":"*Schmerz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":45.55,"end":46.318,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"BERTHOLD!","de":"BERTOLT!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":46.59,"end":51.559,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"*Grunts*","de":"*Grunz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":52.195,"end":55.569,"chars":[4],"who":"Armin","text":"Eren! RUN AWAY!","de":"Eren! LAUF WEG!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":71.24,"end":74.52,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertolt","text":"*Growl*","de":"*Knurrt*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":75.28,"end":76.986,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"*Grunts*","de":"*Grunz*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":92.393,"end":94.476,"chars":[5],"who":"Historia","text":"Huh, EMIR!","de":"Hä — YMIR!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":99.977,"end":100.577,"chars":[4],"who":"Armin","text":"No!","de":"Nein!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":110.23,"end":114.199,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"*Crying*","de":"*Weint*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":114.32,"end":116.938,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"I'm going to return to the home that was taken from me.","de":"Ich werde nach Hause zurückkehren, das mir genommen wurde.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":117.841,"end":120.645,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"I will do it, no matter what.","de":"Ich werde es tun — koste es, was es wolle.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":127.65,"end":132.931,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"Berthold, Reiner *Wailing*","de":"Bertolt… Reiner… *schluchzt*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":136.425,"end":141.1,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"*Grunts* Damn you, YOU TRAITORS!","de":"*Grunz* Verdammt noch mal — IHR VERRÄTER!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":141.515,"end":147.433,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"*Growls*","de":"*Knurrt*","orig":"scenes/aottraitor/lines/28.mp3"}]}